    ClusteringEvaluator...
    >>> evaluator.setWeightCol("weight")
    ClusteringEvaluator...
    >>> evaluator.evaluate(dataset)
    0.9079...
    >>> ce_path = temp_path + "/ce"
    >>> evaluator.save(ce_path)
    >>> evaluator2 = ClusteringEvaluator.load(ce_path)
    >>> str(evaluator2.getPredictionCol())
